cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use methylTFRAnnotationBuilder, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "methylTFRAnnotationBuilder: Build annotation packages for methylTFR"
abstract: >-
  Builds the transcription factor binding site, motif GC frequency and
  genome-wide GC distribution annotations required by the methylTFR
  package, and scaffolds them into an installable annotation package for a
  given genome assembly.
